WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.139 --> 00:00:04.040
A rare sight in St Peter's Square.

00:00:04.040 --> 00:00:10.270
This is part of the Vatican City's new athletics
team...and they are ready to take on the world.

00:00:10.270 --> 00:00:17.730
The Vatican may be the smallest state on earth
but the team has lofty ambitions.

00:00:17.730 --> 00:00:23.880
With regards to the Olympics, the dream we
have is to be carrying the vatican flag during

00:00:23.880 --> 00:00:30.050
the opening ceremony of a Games.

00:00:30.050 --> 00:00:38.789
A marathon-running priest and a half marathon-loving
nun are among the team members.

00:00:38.789 --> 00:00:44.550
For me, when I began running, it gave me the
chance to rediscover inner peace, to find

00:00:44.550 --> 00:00:52.530
a balance, to have time for silence.

00:00:52.530 --> 00:00:56.679
The Vatican competing at the Olympics may
still be a way off.

00:00:56.679 --> 00:00:58.989
But a leap of faith is all they need.

